Hi Avery,

A few things that shipped in Gusto this month:

Time tracking
Hourly and salaried employees can log hours from the mobile app; approved hours flow into payroll automatically.

PTO policies
Build accrual rules per employee group, set carryover limits, and see a team calendar of who's out.

Gusto Wallet
Employees can see pay stubs, set savings goals and split direct deposits from a free app. No setup on your side.

Also: the new hiring checklist walks a new employee through their paperwork, benefits enrollment and direct deposit before day one.

See what's new: https://gusto.com/product-updates/march-2026

